{"id":49,"date":"2025-04-25T13:31:49","date_gmt":"2025-04-25T13:31:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/?page_id=49"},"modified":"2025-07-07T10:57:03","modified_gmt":"2025-07-07T10:57:03","slug":"stempelactie","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/stempelactie\/","title":{"rendered":"Stempelactie"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8a8211ac wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-border-color has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-375c3add wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#203d89;border-width:4px;border-radius:24px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-custom-blauw-color has-text-color has-link-color has-xx-large-font-size wp-elements-0ec977a33b604d8470c33d2ff5064fb6\">Spaar mee &amp; win elke maand!<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Haal nu gratis je stempelkaart op bij \u00e9\u00e9n van de winkels op het Paletplein. Bij iedere aankoop ontvang je een stempel. Heb je je kaart vol? Lever &#8216;m in de stempelbus op het plein en maak automatisch kans op \u00e9\u00e9n van de 10 maandelijkse waardebonnen van <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-custom-rood-color\">\u20ac10,-<\/mark>. Deze zijn te besteden bij alle deelnemende winkels op het Paletplein!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hoe meer je shopt, hoe groter je kans!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#dc2206;border-width:4px;border-radius:24px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-right has-custom-rood-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-3798824d02fc3f34a7815c3e9283d713\">Klik en verzamel de 10 online stempels voor een verrassing!<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\">Klik, stempel en ontdek hoe het werkt \u2013&nbsp;<em>online kun je niet echt winnen, dat doe je alleen op het Paletplein!<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n    \/* Algemene layout *\/\n    .paletplein-stempelkaart {\n        background-color: white;\n        border: 2px solid #203d89;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        padding: 20px;\n        margin: 30px auto;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempelkaart-header {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempelkaart-header h3 {\n        color: #203d89;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempelkaart-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n        gap: 15px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        max-width: 600px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n        .paletplein-stempelkaart-grid {\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n        }\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel {\n        cursor: pointer;\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel:hover {\n        transform: scale(1.05);\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel-svg {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: auto;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel-circle {\n        fill: white;\n        stroke: #203d89;\n        stroke-width: 3;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel-text {\n        fill: #203d89;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 25px;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel-ink {\n        fill: #dc2206;\n        display: none;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-stempel.stamped .paletplein-stempel-ink {\n        display: block;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-waardebon {\n        background-color: #f8f8f8;\n        border: 2px dashed #dc2206;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        padding: 20px;\n        margin: 30px auto;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        text-align: center;\n        display: none;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-waardebon h3 {\n        color: #dc2206;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-winkels-container {\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        padding: 15px;\n        background-color: white;\n        border-radius: 5px;\n        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        min-height: 50px;\n    }\n\n    .logo-carousel {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        background: white;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n\n    .logo-carousel::before,\n    .logo-carousel::after {\n        content: \"\";\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        height: 100%;\n        width: 150px;\n        z-index: 2;\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .logo-carousel::before {\n        left: 0;\n        background: linear-gradient(to right, white 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\n    }\n\n    .logo-carousel::after {\n        right: 0;\n        background: linear-gradient(to left, white 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\n    }\n\n    .logo-track {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        height: 180px;\n        will-change: transform;\n    }\n\n    .logo-item {\n        flex: 0 0 auto;\n        padding: 0 30px;\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    .logo-item:hover {\n        transform: scale(1.15);\n    }\n\n    .logo-item a {\n        display: block;\n        height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .logo-item img {\n        height: 150px;\n        width: auto;\n        max-width: 200px;\n        object-fit: contain;\n        filter: grayscale(20%);\n        transition: filter 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    .logo-item:hover img {\n        filter: grayscale(0%);\n    }\n\n    .paletplein-winkels-container {\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        background-color: transparent !important;\n        border: none !important;\n    }\n  <\/style>\n\n<div class=\"paletplein-stempelkaart\">\n  <div class=\"paletplein-stempelkaart-header\">\n    <h3>Speel Stempelkaart<\/h3>\n    <p>Klik op een stempel om deze te verdienen<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"paletplein-stempelkaart-grid\" id=\"stempelGrid\">\n    <!-- Stempels worden dynamisch gegenereerd -->\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"paletplein-waardebon\" id=\"waardebon\">\n  <h3>\ud83c\udf89 Waardebon \u20ac10,00 \ud83c\udf89<\/h3>\n  <p>Te besteden bij deze winkels:<\/p>\n  <div class=\"paletplein-winkels-container\">\n    <div class=\"logo-carousel\">\n      <div class=\"logo-track\"><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- Confetti JS (van CDN) -->\n<script src=\"https:\/\/cdn.jsdelivr.net\/npm\/canvas-confetti@1.5.1\/dist\/confetti.browser.min.js\"><\/script>\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n    const grid = document.getElementById('stempelGrid');\n    const waardebon = document.getElementById('waardebon');\n\n    \/\/ Stempels genereren\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {\n      const div = document.createElement('div');\n      div.className = 'paletplein-stempel';\n      div.dataset.stempel = i;\n      div.innerHTML = `\n        <svg class=\"paletplein-stempel-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n          <circle class=\"paletplein-stempel-circle\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\"><\/circle>\n          <text class=\"paletplein-stempel-text\" x=\"50\" y=\"55\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${i}<\/text>\n          <path class=\"paletplein-stempel-ink\" d=\"M 50 10 C 25 10 10 25 10 50 C 10 75 25 90 50 90 C 75 90 90 75 90 50 C 90 25 75 10 50 10 Z\"><\/path>\n        <\/svg>\n      `;\n      grid.appendChild(div);\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Functionaliteit\n    const stempels = document.querySelectorAll('.paletplein-stempel');\n    stempels.forEach(stempel => {\n      const num = stempel.dataset.stempel;\n      if (localStorage.getItem('stempel_' + num) === 'true') {\n        stempel.classList.add('stamped');\n      }\n\n      stempel.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        this.classList.toggle('stamped');\n        const isStamped = this.classList.contains('stamped');\n        localStorage.setItem('stempel_' + num, isStamped);\n        checkStempelkaartVol();\n      });\n    });\n\n    function checkStempelkaartVol() {\n      const allStamped = [...stempels].every(s => s.classList.contains('stamped'));\n      if (allStamped && waardebon.style.display !== 'block') {\n        waardebon.style.display = 'block';\n        showConfetti();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function showConfetti() {\n      confetti({\n        particleCount: 150,\n        spread: 70,\n        origin: { y: 0.6 }\n      });\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Init: laat waardebon zien als kaart al vol is\n    checkStempelkaartVol();\n\n    \/\/ Reset knop\n    const resetBtn = document.createElement('button');\n    resetBtn.textContent = 'Reset Stempelkaart';\n    Object.assign(resetBtn.style, {\n      display: 'block',\n      margin: '20px auto',\n      padding: '8px 16px',\n      backgroundColor: '#203d89',\n      color: 'white',\n      border: 'none',\n      borderRadius: '5px',\n      cursor: 'pointer'\n    });\n    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      stempels.forEach(stempel => {\n        stempel.classList.remove('stamped');\n        localStorage.removeItem('stempel_' + stempel.dataset.stempel);\n      });\n      waardebon.style.display = 'none';\n    });\n    document.querySelector('.paletplein-stempelkaart').appendChild(resetBtn);\n\n    \/\/ Logo carousel\n    const logos = [\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/De-Haas-Opticien-Logo.jpg\", \n        href: \"\/de-haas-opticien\",\n        alt: \"De Haas Opticien\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/AC-AP-logo.webp\", \n        href: \"\/ac-ap\",\n        alt: \"AC-AP\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Afhaalcentrum-Welkom-logo.png\", \n        href: \"\/afhaalcentrum-welkom\",\n        alt: \"Afhaalcentrum Welkom\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Floor-van-Lieshout-logo.png\", \n        href: \"\/bakkerij-floor-van-lieshout\/\",\n        alt: \"Bakkerij Floor van Lieshout\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Dodeka-ink-logo.jpg\", \n        href: \"\/dodeka-ink\",\n        alt: \"Dodeka ink\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/eethuis-paletplein-logo.webp\", \n        href: \"\/eethuis-paletplein\",\n        alt: \"Eethuis Paletplein\"\n      },\n     { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Kokkys-logo.png\", \n        href: \"\/kokkys\",\n        alt: \"Kokky's\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Philipsen-Specialiteiten-logo.webp\", \n        href: \"\/philipsen-specialiteiten\",\n        alt: \"Philipsen Specialiteiten\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/logo_tvdk_retina.png\", \n        href: \"\/rijwielhandel-ton-van-de-klundert\/\",\n        alt: \"Ton van de Klundert\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/tons-salon-logo-zwart.png\", \n        href: \"\/tons-salon\/\",\n        alt: \"T'Ons Salon\"\n      },\n      { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Thelmas-Toko-logo.png\", \n        href: \"\/thelmas-toko\",\n        alt: \"Thelma's Toko\"\n      },\n       { \n        src: \"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Trekpleister-logo-scaled.avif\", \n        href: \"\/trekpleister\",\n        alt: \"Trekpleister\"\n      }\n    ];\n\n    const carousel = document.querySelector('.logo-carousel');\n    const logoTrack = document.querySelector('.logo-track');\n    let position = 0, animationId, lastTimestamp = 0;\n    const speed = 50;\n\n    function createLogoItem(logo) {\n      const item = document.createElement('div');\n      item.className = 'logo-item';\n      const link = document.createElement('a');\n      link.href = logo.href;\n      const img = document.createElement('img');\n      img.src = logo.src;\n      img.alt = logo.alt;\n      link.appendChild(img);\n      item.appendChild(link);\n      return item;\n    }\n\n    function initializeLogos() {\n      logoTrack.innerHTML = '';\n      logos.concat(logos).forEach(logo => logoTrack.appendChild(createLogoItem(logo)));\n      startAnimation();\n    }\n\n    function startAnimation() {\n      lastTimestamp = performance.now();\n      animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    }\n\n    function animate(timestamp) {\n      const dt = (timestamp - lastTimestamp) \/ 1000;\n      lastTimestamp = timestamp;\n      position -= speed * dt;\n      if (position <= -logoTrack.scrollWidth \/ 2) position = 0;\n      logoTrack.style.transform = `translateX(${position}px)`;\n      animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    }\n\n    carousel.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => cancelAnimationFrame(animationId));\n    carousel.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n      lastTimestamp = performance.now();\n      animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n      cancelAnimationFrame(animationId);\n      position = 0;\n      initializeLogos();\n    });\n\n    initializeLogos();\n  });\n<\/script>\n\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Spaar mee &amp; win elke maand! Haal nu gratis je stempelkaart op bij \u00e9\u00e9n van de winkels op het Paletplein. Bij iedere aankoop ontvang je een stempel. Heb je je kaart vol? Lever &#8216;m in de stempelbus op het plein en maak automatisch kans op \u00e9\u00e9n van de 10 maandelijkse waardebonnen van \u20ac10,-. Deze zijn [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-no-title","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-49","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/49","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=49"}],"version-history":[{"count":18,"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/49\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":614,"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/49\/revisions\/614"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/paletplein.nl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=49"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}